IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part5-sharing`

-- Tests for regulation 14 and the Schedule (spr-part5-sharing.l4): the inserted
-- regulations 6 and 7 of the 2000 Regulations. Expected values are decided from the
-- text of the inserted regulation named beside each group, before running.

§ `Fixtures: information requests`
`a request with a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the person who has shareable new state scheme rights`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS NOTHING
`a request with a valuation, proceedings notified, received on 15 Jan 2027` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the person who has shareable new state scheme rights`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS TRUE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS NOTHING
`a court order with a valuation, shorter period to 1 Feb 2027` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the court, by an order`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS JUST (YMD 2027 2 1)
`a court order with a valuation, shorter period to 30 Jun 2027` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the court, by an order`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS JUST (YMD 2027 6 30)
`a court order with a valuation, no shorter period` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the court, by an order`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS NOTHING
`a person request with a valuation that names a court period, which does not apply to a person` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
    `who makes the request or order` IS `the person who has shareable new state scheme rights`
    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS JUST (YMD 2027 2 1)
`a person request without a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027` MEANS InformationRequest WITH
