    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS FALSE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS FALSE
