    `the date the Secretary of State receives the request or order` IS YMD 2027 1 15
    `the request or order asks for a valuation under paragraphs (2) to (4) or an amount under paragraph (5)` IS TRUE
    `the person notified the Secretary of State by that date that the information is needed in connection with proceedings under a provision referred to in section 23(1)(a) of the 1999 Act` IS TRUE
    `the last day of any shorter period the court has specified in an order, if any` IS JUST (YMD 2027 2 1)

§ `Inserted regulation 6(1): what must be furnished`

#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(1): the information the Secretary of State must furnish` `the person who has shareable new state scheme rights` EQUALS `the information in paragraphs (2) to (6)`
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(1): the information the Secretary of State must furnish` `the court, by an order` EQUALS `the information in paragraphs (2) to (6)`
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(1): the information the Secretary of State must furnish` `the spouse or civil partner of the person who has shareable new state scheme rights` EQUALS `the information in paragraph (6) only`

§ `Inserted regulation 6(2) to (5): which valuation`

-- (2): no relevant date, received after commencement: valuation as at the date of receipt.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` NOTHING (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS JUST `a valuation of the shareable new state scheme rights as at the date the request is received`
-- (3): relevant date on or after 6 April 2016: new rights as at the relevant date (boundary: 6 April 2016 itself).
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` (JUST (YMD 2016 4 6)) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS JUST `a valuation of the shareable new state scheme rights as at the relevant date`
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS JUST `a valuation of the shareable new state scheme rights as at the relevant date`
-- (4): relevant date before 6 April 2016 and request received on or after it: previous old rights.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` (JUST (YMD 2016 4 5)) (YMD 2016 4 6) EQUALS JUST `a valuation of the previous shareable old state scheme rights as at the relevant date`
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` (JUST (YMD 2010 1 1)) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS JUST `a valuation of the previous shareable old state scheme rights as at the relevant date`
-- A request received before the Regulations came into force is outside the inserted regulation.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` NOTHING (YMD 2016 4 5) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(2) to (4): the valuation to be given` (JUST (YMD 2010 1 1)) (YMD 2016 4 5) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5): the former Category A amount, where the relevant date is before 6 April 2016 and the request arrives on or after it.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(5): the amount of the former Category A entitlement may be given` (JUST (YMD 2016 4 5)) (YMD 2016 4 6)
#ASSERT NOT (`inserted regulation 6(5): the amount of the former Category A entitlement may be given` (JUST (YMD 2016 4 6)) (YMD 2016 4 6))
#ASSERT NOT (`inserted regulation 6(5): the amount of the former Category A entitlement may be given` NOTHING (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`inserted regulation 6(5): the amount of the former Category A entitlement may be given` (JUST (YMD 2016 4 5)) (YMD 2016 4 5))

§ `Inserted regulation 6(7): three months, six weeks, a shorter period set by the court`

-- Three months beginning with 15 Jan 2027 end on 14 Apr 2027 (convention F2).
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a request with a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 14
-- Six weeks beginning with 15 Jan 2027: 42 days, ending 25 Feb 2027 (convention F1).
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a request with a valuation, proceedings notified, received on 15 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 25
-- A shorter period the court sets: 1 Feb 2027 is earlier than the three months, so it governs.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a court order with a valuation, shorter period to 1 Feb 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 1
-- A "shorter period" that is in fact later than three months does not extend the time (fork F18).
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a court order with a valuation, shorter period to 30 Jun 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 14
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a court order with a valuation, no shorter period` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 14
-- Paragraph (7)(c) is the court's power: a person's own request cannot shorten the time that way.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a person request with a valuation that names a court period, which does not apply to a person` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 14
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a person request with a valuation, notified, court period to 1 Feb 2027 (ignored)` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 25

§ `Inserted regulation 6(8): one month`

-- A request or order with no valuation or amount: one month beginning with the day of receipt.
-- 15 Jan 2027 to 14 Feb 2027.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(8): the one-month period applies` `a person request without a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027`
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a person request without a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 14
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a court order without a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 14
-- A spouse's or civil partner's request for the paragraph (6) information: one month as well.
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a spouse request received on 15 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 14
-- No corresponding date for a month beginning 31 Jan: the last day of February (convention F2, not in the text).
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 6(7) and (8): the last day by which the Secretary of State must furnish the information` `a person request without a valuation received on 31 Jan 2027` EQUALS YMD 2027 2 28
-- A request that does include a valuation is not in the one-month group.
#ASSERT NOT (`inserted regulation 6(8): the one-month period applies` `a request with a valuation received on 15 Jan 2027`)

§ `Inserted regulation 7: the Government Actuary`

#ASSERT `inserted regulation 7: the valuation is calculated and verified in accordance with the Government Actuary's guidance` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 7: the valuation is calculated and verified in accordance with the Government Actuary's guidance` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `inserted regulation 7: the valuation is calculated and verified in accordance with the Government Actuary's guidance` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`inserted regulation 7: the valuation is calculated and verified in accordance with the Government Actuary's guidance` FALSE FALSE)
